{"title":"2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adam and Budan are playing a game of Bocce. Each wants their ball to land closest to the jack ball. The positions of Adam’s ball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, Budan's ball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and the jack ball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb5588023cfa1ac14643e9778699f03eecc57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$J$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> are shown in the diagram.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the distance from B to A?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> would be represented by the length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/6/d66492998689e8303534c9e4f3ba1fa650fd41f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" />. We can use right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc62d7c9f2dbdf2796228f0921f6fc77f1fdb33f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BAQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" /> to find this length, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/6/d66492998689e8303534c9e4f3ba1fa650fd41f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> is one of its legs.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(image of specifically triangle BAQ)\n</p><p>From the Pythagorean theorem, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377c30e5d5775f650acd4d8ba4ded4b035f78f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA^{2} + AQ^{2} = BQ^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a1d74d4ca916a70db0f32ba2727b58396adf2a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA^{2} = BQ^{2} - AQ^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/8707dc6f47725aad3f063a7556107766c26aaa6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA = \\sqrt{BQ^{2} - AQ^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a967d037d4261a5860188b7fecc19d92f6663f06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BQ = 39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e4922cbaf442a86f456bc1301e64af5b3c7336d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AQ = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/9/629ef3a5f984ae2b2e2cd9ac8ef8d9ea04d6f210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA = \\sqrt{39^{2} - 15^{2}} = \\sqrt{1521 - 225}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"268\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9d2e3f276a5beb4a18a485e4f32410137fe9805.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sqrt{1296} = \\boxed{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"126\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 67/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1476/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2672/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.576      1 -total\n 94.03%   13.706      1 2012_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\n 38.64%    5.632      2 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35639:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230530 and revision id 278090. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}